# ================================================================
# GNOSIS
# Universal Scientific Discovery & Intelligence Platform
#
# UROBOROS — Ψ-Core v33
#
# Purpose:
# This file prevents local environments, secrets, temporary files,
# generated research outputs and machine-specific artifacts from
# being accidentally committed to the public GNOSIS repository.
#
# Public source code, tests, documentation, examples and reproducible
# research materials SHOULD NOT be ignored unless they contain
# confidential, private or generated information.
#
# Copyright © 2026 Mikhail Kucheriaviy.
# All rights reserved except where expressly granted by the
# applicable project license.
# ================================================================


