# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT
#
# The following project directories MUST remain trackable:
#
#   src/
#   tests/
#   examples/
#   experiments/
#   benchmarks/
#   docs/
#
# They contain the public research implementation, reproducibility
# materials and scientific documentation of GNOSIS.
#
# Do NOT add these directories to .gitignore unless a specific
# subdirectory contains private or generated material.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
